-Yeah. move it!

404
00:35:05.172 --> 00:35:06.507
You gotta move!

405
00:35:15.550 --> 00:35:17.417
You gotta get it right now!

406
00:35:23.123 --> 00:35:24.559
Move back!

407
00:35:25.059 --> 00:35:26.259
Move back!

408
00:35:35.168 --> 00:35:37.404
Got you. Hang in.
Stay over there.

409
00:35:40.975 --> 00:35:42.577
Fuck! Give me gauze.

