473
00:47:41.428 --> 00:47:42.429
Hey.

474
00:47:44.298 --> 00:47:45.332
Out of interest.

475
00:47:47.000 --> 00:47:48.536
are you guys aware
there's like

476
00:47:49.903 --> 00:47:51.773
a pretty huge civil war
going on

477
00:47:51.872 --> 00:47:53.040
