493
00:48:58.439 --> 00:48:59.440
Come on.

494
00:48:59.908 --> 00:49:01.108
Yes.

495
00:49:16.323 --> 00:49:18.125
You're gonna
take the photo?

496
00:49:18.225 --> 00:49:19.761
